+    state.py:211) and the next beat for a BUILT bundle is CHECK, not Do (`driver.advance`,
+    driver.py:76) — so after a partial patch a plain re-run REVIEWS the residue instead of
+    rebuilding it. Reporting only: nothing here removes the builder's artifacts. They may
